            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Stacy Rose"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this to take to a Thanksgiving potluck and thought it was very tasty. Next time though I would peel potatoes and cube instead of slice. Also, I couldn't find any dill relish -- I used sweet. Yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2004-11-26T15:47:34.297Z"
